{
  "uid": "ai-demo-pinggateway",
  "title": "PingGateway",
  "description": "Metrics PingGateway publishes about itself on its admin connector. Nothing here is computed by demo code.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-demo",
    "pinggateway",
    "mcp"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "route",
        "label": "Route",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(ig_route_request_total, route)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About these numbers",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "PingGateway counts its own work and publishes it on the admin connector (`:8085`, separate from the port serving routes). Prometheus scrapes it every 15s. **No value on this dashboard is derived from demo code.**\n\nOne caveat, verified live: `ig_mcp_error_total` does **not** count requests whose JSON-RPC envelope fails schema validation. The gateway rejects them with a 400 but the counter stays flat, so MCP error figures are a **floor, not a total**. See `TECH_DEBT.md`. Corroborate with the status-family panel, which counts every response."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "MCP calls by method (per 5 min)",
      "description": "MCP methods the gateway validated, as calls per 5 minutes rather than a per-second rate — demo traffic is far too sparse for req/s to read usefully.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (mcp_method) (increase(ig_mcp_method_time_seconds_count{route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{mcp_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisSoftMax": 5
          },
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "MCP errors by JSON-RPC code (per 5 min, a floor)",
      "description": "Rejections the gateway counted. Schema-invalid envelopes are rejected without being counted — see the note at the top.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (mcp_error) (increase(ig_mcp_error_total{route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{mcp_error}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisSoftMax": 5
          },
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Tool calls by tool (cumulative)",
      "description": "Which MCP tools have actually been invoked through the gateway.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (mcp_method_param_tool) (ig_mcp_method_time_seconds_count{mcp_method=\"tools/call\", route=~\"$route\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{mcp_method_param_tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by route",
      "description": "Every route the gateway serves, not just the MCP doors.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(ig_route_request_total{route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Responses by status family",
      "description": "Counts every response, including the rejections the MCP error counter misses.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (family) (rate(ig_route_response_status_total{route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{family}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "client_error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "server_error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "successful"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mean response time by route",
      "description": "sum/count over the 5m window — the gateway publishes a summary, so this is a true mean rather than an estimated quantile.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(ig_route_response_time_seconds_sum{route=~\"$route\"}[5m])) / sum by (route) (rate(ig_route_response_time_seconds_count{route=~\"$route\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gateway JVM heap",
      "description": "Used against max. Here because an unhealthy gateway explains slow MCP calls faster than any MCP metric will.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ig_jvm_used_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "used"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "ig_jvm_max_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "max"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "max"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Live logs",
      "description": "This container's stdout (Tier 2 — Grafana Alloy). Narrow with the panel's own search box, e.g. |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\" or |= \"ERROR\".",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=\"ping-gateway\"}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Traces (Jaeger)",
      "tooltip": "Open Explore on the Jaeger datasource — the same gateway, per request",
      "icon": "external link",
      "url": "/grafana/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22ai-demo-jaeger%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22queryType%22%3A%22search%22%2C%22service%22%3A%22pinggateway%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22now-1h%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22now%22%7D%7D",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ]
}
